# Terraform ecosystem

Read `ecosystems/terraform/AGENTS.md` for full constraints.

## Key rules

- All resources MUST be inside `modules/`, not at root level (ADR-TF-001)
- checkov suppressions require a comment with justification
- Variable defaults must NOT contain environment-specific values
- Run `cd ecosystems/terraform && make verify` after changes

## Stack

Terraform, tflint (AWS plugin), checkov.
